</span></span><span id="S3.T1.5.1.2.3.2.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.5.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="S3.T1.5.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="S3.T1.5.1.2.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <span id="S3.T1.5.1.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text">
